{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/909719-cult-of-mitra-as-conspiracy","id":909719,"title":"Cult of Mitra as Conspiracy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-07T19:16:01-07:00","id":909719,"title":"Cult of Mitra as Conspiracy","content":"I think the Cult of Mitra from the Changeling 2e playtest document makes sense when you realize alot of their abilities are geared towards hunting huntsmen and other threats to the Changelings of the Toronto Freehold, Especially the Ivory Court.<br /> <br /> So I'm wondering how turn it into a fully fleshed Hunter Conspiracy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-07T23:10:15-07:00","id":909872,"title":"","content":"While I haven't made a full conspiracy writeup, I did made an Endowment for them at &quot;Going Up the Tiers&quot;=<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b><u>Cult of Mitra- Divine Fate (0-00000, Special)</u></b><br /> The human members of the Ivory Court protect their gods from the dark Daeva who seek to pull the Peri back to their iron cages, and Fate stands on their side when they do so. When taking the Merit the hunter choose a single Fate, which could be described in a single word (like Warrior, Scholar, Lover, etc). The hunter can use that Endowment in a number of ways- first, he can use that Fate to help them in their goal. By expanding WP point, the hunter may add her dots to a specific roll which works in the theme of their Fate (for example, a Warrior may add those dots when he attack seeking glory in battle, while a Lover would have to protect his special one from an enemy). Second, the hunter could roll her dots in a certain Fate in order to see the future- or, more exactly, her role in the story. She may add her Divine Fate dots to any Investigation roll which is meant to show her the preferred course of action considering her Fate, although she does not include the finale outcome of her role (including possible death). While the character may take more than one Fate, she must follow the theme of her chosen destiny- and if she defies it somehow (like a Warrior running away from battle) she would lose one WP point and would not be able to use that Fate for the rest of the Chapter. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T04:27:11-07:00","id":909970,"title":"","content":"That's pretty cool.<br /> <br /> Honestly I originally was thinking of two subgroups of endowments, one based on the original merits, focusing on dreams/predicting the future, the other deals with their Fae Gods for access to they're Fae Magic.<br /> <br /> Like one Path of the Endowment is Stuff like gaining Unseen Sense (Huntsmen), Lucid Dreamer, Diviner, Thief of Fate, and maybe some waycof permantly killing a Huntsmen.<br /> <br /> The other Path, could be more alone the lines of trading Bargains, for things like Ensocrellment, Dream vessels that do various things like healing, perhaps even tokens or Hedge Beasts.<br /> <br /> But you idea makes for a really cool third path, it reminds me of the 1e Changeling Archetype Merits from Swords at Dusk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}